From: VIKINGYFY <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:57:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sqlite: upgrade embedded engine to fix the WAL reset race

Upgrade modernc.org/sqlite to v1.46.2 and its matching libc to v1.70.0,
which embeds SQLite 3.51.3 with the upstream WAL-reset race fix. Keep the
multi-connection WAL configuration and update the required module sums.

Reference: https://www.sqlite.org/wal.html#walresetbug

Base-Commit: 0896305eeee89435049575d55a813f72901f703b

---

--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -78,5 +78,5 @@ require (
 	gopkg.in/natefinch/lumberjack.v2 v2.2.1
 	gopkg.in/yaml.v3 v3.0.1
-	modernc.org/sqlite v1.40.1
+	modernc.org/sqlite v1.46.2
 )
 
@@ -231,5 +231,5 @@ require (
 	google.golang.org/grpc v1.84.0 // indirect
 	google.golang.org/protobuf v1.36.12 // indirect
-	modernc.org/libc v1.67.1 // indirect
+	modernc.org/libc v1.70.0 // indirect
 	modernc.org/mathutil v1.7.1 // indirect
 	modernc.org/memory v1.11.0 // indirect
